#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model:ir.model,name:account_overdue_control.model_sale_order
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_overdue_control.selection__account_overdue_bypass_wizard__res_model__sale_order
msgid "Sales Order"
msgstr "Orden de venta"

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The following invoices cannot be posted because the customer has overdue invoices past their payment term due dates:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"Register the pending payments, exempt the customer with a reason, or ask an authorized user to bypass the block with a reason."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes facturas no se pueden publicar porque el cliente tiene facturas vencidas que superaron los días de sus términos de pago:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"Registre los pagos pendientes, marque al cliente como exento indicando el motivo o solicite a un usuario autorizado que omita el bloqueo ingresando un motivo."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"The following sales orders cannot be confirmed and must remain as quotations because the customer has overdue invoices past their payment term due dates:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"Register the pending payments, exempt the customer with a reason, or ask an authorized user to bypass the block with a reason."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes órdenes de venta no se pueden confirmar y permanecerán como cotizaciones porque el cliente tiene facturas vencidas que superaron los días de sus términos de pago:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"Registre los pagos pendientes, marque al cliente como exento indicando el motivo o solicite a un usuario autorizado que omita el bloqueo ingresando un motivo."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/wizard/overdue_bypass_wizard.py:0
