msgstr "El documento destino ya no existe."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "This invoice is not currently blocked by overdue invoices."
msgstr "Esta factura no se encuentra actualmente bloqueada por mora."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "This sales order is not currently blocked by overdue invoices."
msgstr "Esta orden de venta no se encuentra actualmente bloqueada por mora."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_overdue_control.field_res_company__overdue_tolerance
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_overdue_control.field_res_config_settings__overdue_tolerance
msgid "Tolerated Overdue Amount"
msgstr "Monto vencido tolerado"

#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:account_overdue_control.constraint_res_company_check_overdue_tolerance
msgid "Tolerated overdue amount must be greater than or equal to 0."
msgstr "El monto vencido tolerado debe ser mayor o igual a 0."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model:res.groups,comment:account_overdue_control.group_overdue_control_bypass
msgid ""
"Users in this group can authorize and bypass the overdue invoices block on "
"sales orders and customer invoices by providing a mandatory reason, and can "
"manage customer exemptions."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios de este grupo pueden autorizar y omitir el bloqueo por "
"facturas vencidas en órdenes de venta y facturas de cliente indicando un "
"motivo obligatorio, y pueden gestionar las exenciones de clientes."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_overdue_control.view_move_form_overdue_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_overdue_control.view_order_form_overdue_control
msgid "View overdue invoices"
msgstr "Ver facturas vencidas"

#. module: account_overdue_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_overdue_control.field_res_company__overdue_control_enabled
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_overdue_control.field_res_config_settings__overdue_control_enabled
msgid ""
"When enabled, all customers with posted unpaid invoices past their payment "
"term due date (plus grace days) and exceeding the tolerated amount are "
"blocked from confirming sales orders and posting new customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activo, todos los clientes con facturas publicadas impagas cuya "
"fecha de vencimiento (según términos de pago más días de gracia) haya "
"pasado y cuyo saldo supere la tolerancia quedan bloqueados para confirmar "
"órdenes de venta y publicar nuevas facturas."

#. module: account_overdue_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/account_move.py:0
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/models/sale_order.py:0
#: code:addons/account_overdue_control/wizard/overdue_bypass_wizard.py:0
msgid "You are not authorized to bypass the overdue invoices block."
msgstr "No está autorizado para omitir el bloqueo por facturas vencidas."
